# CHG-2066 (approved): the partner sign-in service (`partners`, today a PingAM realm) is to run on Microsoft Entra
# External ID in the target: an external tenant the platform team keeps. Nothing of it renders yet (the target's
# render names the tenant and app registrations to create by hand), and the planner checks the service against what
# Microsoft documents of it: it exists in the target's public cloud (not in Azure Government), and what isn't
# documented either way waits for Microsoft's confirmation in the unknowns register.
dn: cn=partners-external-id,ou=bindings,env=prod,cloud=target,ou=environments,dc=ciam-ops
changetype: add
objectClass: top
objectClass: ciamManagedIdentity
cn: partners-external-id
ciamBindingRole: partners-identity
ciamManagedService: entra-external-id
ciamRealizes: partners
ciamOwner: cn=ciam-platform,ou=owners,dc=ciam-ops
ciamChangeRef: cn=CHG-2066,ou=changes,dc=ciam-ops
description: The partners realm's external tenant (Microsoft Entra External ID)
